# The pnpm store for this package lives outside it and must be supplied
# explicitly, because the Home drive (C:) and the workspace drive (D:) differ:
# pnpm then infers a different default store location for `install` and `add`,
# and fails with ERR_PNPM_UNEXPECTED_STORE.
#
#   pnpm install --store-dir <workspace>/.pnpm-store
#   pnpm add -D <pkg> --store-dir <workspace>/.pnpm-store
#
# Nothing here is needed to build or run the plugin; it only affects how its dev
# dependencies are (re)installed.
